!
! A seed or supply line's cost (dibber_rules.h DR4), in Trebago, one line
! a row: count units at price minor units each, count * price minor
! units, exact. A negative count or price makes ok 0 and the answer a
! division by zero, refused; past 64 bits Trebago refuses by itself. Any
! other count and price are answered, so past cost.sutra's pictures (a
! count of 1000000 or more, a price of 10 digits) Sutra refuses, Trebago
! answers: held.
trebago seed_supply_cost
  in  count(n), price(n)
  out cost(n)
  var ok(n)
  ok(i) = min(1, max(0, count(i) + 1)) * min(1, max(0, price(i) + 1))
  cost(i) = count(i) * price(i) / ok(i)
end
